After dinner, I go into the living room.
The apartment is lovely and warm.
Outside, it is dark and cold.
I turn on a small lamp.
The light is warm and soft.
I make a warm cup of tea.
Then I walk over to the sofa.
I sit down on the soft cushions.
On the table lies a new book.
I take the book and open it.
It is an exciting story.
I read a few chapters.
My tea smells good.
I take a sip.
I lean back.
Now I relax completely.
It is completely quiet in the apartment.
I enjoy my time alone.
